  unitName: Rainbow Goddess Tilith
  unitId: 50256
  unitNumber: 1336
  description: A mock Unit modeled after the Goddess Tilith. Bent on creating a perfect
    clone of the Goddess, Noel gathered as much detailed information as he could
    from her closest companion, the Summoner. After much trial and error, Tilith's
    mock Unit was able to evolve into a sublime deity after the battle her original
    counterpart had faced in another world. However, since those closest to Tilith
    had too many demands on how her mock Unit should be developed, this one failed
    to live up to every single one of their expectations.
  summonDesc: Never give up!<br>You are my Summoner,<br>and everyone's ray of hope!
  fusionDesc: Fusion feels weird! He he.<br>I can't let you down though!
  evoDesc: Energy is coursing through me...<br>With this power I can protect everyone!
